kubernetes-webai-rag

Derived from VectorSearch.js by Jason Mayes (2026):
https://github.com/jasonmayes/VectorSearch.js
The original Apache-2.0 license and authorship notices are retained.

Modifications include offline Kubernetes corpus preparation, source heading
citations, hybrid retrieval, local documentation, Gemma 4 answer generation,
persistent model caching, and Windows distribution.

This is an independent application, not an official Kubernetes, Google or
VectorSearch.js release. Kubernetes documentation is licensed under CC BY 4.0.
EmbeddingGemma weights use the Gemma terms. Gemma 4 and LiteRT-LM use Apache-2.0.
